  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen changing the window size the resolution drop-down doesn't immediately update to show the new resolution.\n\nFor it to update you have to go to a different Settings page and back.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:**\n\n1. Open the Graphic Settings\n\n2. Change the window size\n\nIf you do this you will notice that the resolution shown has not updated.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nAfter changing the window size the resolution shown should immediately update to show the new resolution.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:",
